# Force LF in the working tree on every OS. The windows-unit CI job compares CLI
# output (built from \n template literals) against committed golden fixtures; a
# Windows checkout that converted those goldens to CRLF would fail the golden
# tests. Normalizing to LF keeps Windows byte-identical to Linux and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Tracked binaries: never normalize.
*.png binary
